{"seq":3,"slug":"esg-sustainable-supply-chain","title":"ESG 与可持续供应链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/esg-sustainable-supply-chain","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"esg-与可持续供应链\">ESG 与可持续供应链</h1><p>可持续性（Sustainability）从供应链的&quot;加分项&quot;变成了&quot;合规底线&quot;。欧盟 CSRD（企业可持续发展报告指令）于 2024 年开始分阶段生效，要求数千家企业披露供应链的环境与社会影响。ASCM 将&quot;气候与循环经济&quot;列入 2026 年供应链十大趋势，Gartner 预测到 2027 年 ESG 将从&quot;品牌加分&quot;转变为&quot;准入门槛&quot;。对于供应链团队而言，ESG 不再是公关部门的事——它直接影响供应商选择、采购成本、物流路由和产品设计决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-供应链-esg-的三维框架\">核心概念：供应链 ESG 的三维框架</h2><p>ESG 在供应链中的落地分为三个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>供应链相关议题</th>\n<th>核心度量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Environment（环境）</td>\n<td>碳排放（Scope 1/2/3）、资源消耗、废弃物、水足迹</td>\n<td>tCO2e、能耗强度、废弃物回收率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Social（社会）</td>\n<td>供应商劳工权益、安全生产、社区影响、多样性</td>\n<td>审计通过率、工伤率、生活工资覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Governance（治理）</td>\n<td>供应链透明度、反腐败、数据安全、负责任采购</td>\n<td>供应商披露率、合规审计频次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>供应链通常贡献了企业 80-90% 的碳排放（Scope 3），这意味着减碳不可能仅靠&quot;管好自己的工厂&quot;，必须深入到供应商网络的每一层级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Scope 1 直接排放&#10;        F1[自有工厂排放]&#10;        F2[自有车队排放]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Scope 2 间接排放&#10;        E1[购入电力]&#10;        E2[购入蒸汽/热力]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Scope 3 价值链排放&#10;        UP[上游&lt;br/&gt;原材料开采+加工&lt;br/&gt;供应商生产&lt;br/&gt;入境运输]&#10;        DN[下游&lt;br/&gt;产品使用&lt;br/&gt;终端物流&lt;br/&gt;废弃处置]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Scope 1 直接排放\n        F1[自有工厂排放]\n        F2[自有车队排放]\n    end\n    subgraph Scope 2 间接排放\n        E1[购入电力]\n        E2[购入蒸汽/热力]\n    end\n    subgraph Scope 3 价值链排放\n        UP[上游&lt;br/&gt;原材料开采+加工&lt;br/&gt;供应商生产&lt;br/&gt;入境运输]\n        DN[下游&lt;br/&gt;产品使用&lt;br/&gt;终端物流&lt;br/&gt;废弃处置]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"碳足迹核算-ghg-protocol-与-glec-框架\">碳足迹核算：GHG Protocol 与 GLEC 框架</h2><p>供应链碳足迹核算遵循 GHG Protocol 的 Scope 3 标准。对于物流环节，GLEC（Global Logistics Emissions Council）框架提供了更细化的计算方法。</p>\n<p>Scope 3 上游排放的计算基本公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{scope3} = \\sum_{i} Activity_i \\times EF_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Activity_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为活动量（如运输的吨公里数、采购物料的吨数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为对应的排放因子。</p>\n<p>2026 年碳核算的关键挑战在于数据质量的层级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据层级</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>获取难度</th>\n<th>典型使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一级（实测数据）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高——需供应商实际计量</td>\n<td>战略供应商、Tier-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级（供应商平均）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中——需供应商协作</td>\n<td>重要供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级（行业平均）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低——公开数据库</td>\n<td>Tier-2/3、长尾供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四级（估算/推算）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最低——基于支出金额推算</td>\n<td>初始筛选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>大多数企业的 Scope 3 核算仍以三级和四级数据为主，但 CSRD 的精度要求正在推动企业向一/二级数据过渡——这需要与供应商建立数据共享机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商-esg-管理体系\">供应商 ESG 管理体系</h2><p>将 ESG 要求嵌入供应商全生命周期管理：</p>\n<p><strong>准入阶段</strong> — 新供应商审核中加入 ESG 门槛：环境管理体系认证（ISO 14001）、劳工合规审计（SA8000 或 SMETA）、碳排放基线数据。不满足最低要求的供应商不予准入。</p>\n<p><strong>运营阶段</strong> — 将 ESG 指标纳入供应商绩效评估的常规维度（如前文采购章节中 QCD+S 框架的 S 维度）。定期审计与改善计划。</p>\n<p><strong>发展阶段</strong> — 对战略供应商投入资源帮助其提升 ESG 能力：提供碳核算工具培训、协助安装节能设备、分享最佳实践。</p>\n<p><strong>退出阶段</strong> — 对持续不达标且无改善意愿的供应商启动退出机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[准入门槛&lt;br/&gt;ESG 最低标准] --&gt; B[绩效管理&lt;br/&gt;定期评估+审计]&#10;    B --&gt; C[能力提升&lt;br/&gt;培训+投入]&#10;    C --&gt; D[长期合作&lt;br/&gt;联合减碳目标]&#10;    B --&gt;|不达标| E[改善计划]&#10;    E --&gt;|仍不达标| F[退出]\">graph LR\n    A[准入门槛&lt;br/&gt;ESG 最低标准] --&gt; B[绩效管理&lt;br/&gt;定期评估+审计]\n    B --&gt; C[能力提升&lt;br/&gt;培训+投入]\n    C --&gt; D[长期合作&lt;br/&gt;联合减碳目标]\n    B --&gt;|不达标| E[改善计划]\n    E --&gt;|仍不达标| F[退出]</pre><h2 id=\"循环供应链-circular-supply-chain\">循环供应链（Circular Supply Chain）</h2><p>传统的&quot;取-做-废&quot;（Take-Make-Dispose）线性模型正在向循环模型转变。循环供应链的核心是在产品生命周期结束时将材料和能量回收到价值循环中。</p>\n<p>循环供应链的五大策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>供应链影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reduce（减量）</td>\n<td>从设计阶段减少材料使用</td>\n<td>减少采购量和废弃物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reuse（重用）</td>\n<td>产品或包装的多次使用</td>\n<td>逆向物流回收体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repair（维修）</td>\n<td>延长产品使用寿命</td>\n<td>备件供应链、服务网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remanufacture（再制造）</td>\n<td>将旧产品恢复到新品状态</td>\n<td>逆向物流+正向制造融合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recycle（回收）</td>\n<td>材料级别的回收利用</td>\n<td>回收物流+二次原材料供应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>循环供应链对电商的特殊意义：电商的退货率（15-30%）远高于线下零售（5-8%），这意味着逆向物流本身就是一个庞大的材料流。将退货商品有效分流到&quot;翻新→重售&quot;&quot;维修→返回&quot;&quot;拆解→回收&quot;等通道，而非一律销毁或折价处理，是电商循环供应链的核心命题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"esg-合规的技术赋能\">ESG 合规的技术赋能</h2><p>2026 年 ESG 软件市场快速增长，关键技术能力：</p>\n<p><strong>碳排放追踪平台</strong> — 自动化采集供应链各环节的活动数据，按 GHG Protocol 计算 Scope 1/2/3 排放。代表产品：Persefoni、Watershed、Plan A。</p>\n<p><strong>数字产品护照（DPP）</strong> — 欧盟 ESPR（可持续产品生态设计法规）要求特定品类产品携带数字护照，记录材料来源、碳足迹、可回收性等信息。基于区块链实现不可篡改的溯源。</p>\n<p><strong>供应商 ESG 评级平台</strong> — 聚合公开数据+供应商自报数据+第三方审计结果，为每个供应商生成 ESG 风险评分。代表：EcoVadis、Sedex、CDP。</p>\n<p><strong>AI 驱动的 ESG 优化</strong> — 在采购决策中将碳成本纳入 TCO 计算，在路由规划中将碳排放作为优化目标之一。目标函数从单一的&quot;最低成本&quot;扩展为&quot;最低成本+碳排放约束&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum c_{ij} x_{ij} \\quad s.t. \\quad \\sum e_{ij} x_{ij} \\leq E_{cap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ij</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span> 的碳排放，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{cap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为碳排放预算上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"esg-供应链的经济性\">ESG 供应链的经济性</h2><p>一个常见的误解是&quot;ESG 只增加成本&quot;。实际上，供应链 ESG 实践的经济回报来自多个渠道：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回报渠道</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>典型回报</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能效改善</td>\n<td>节能设备、路由优化、装载率提升</td>\n<td>运营成本降低 5-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>废弃物减少</td>\n<td>包装减量、材料回收</td>\n<td>原材料成本降低 3-8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险降低</td>\n<td>供应商合规管理减少中断</td>\n<td>避免合规罚款和声誉损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>融资优势</td>\n<td>ESG 评级高的企业获得更低利率</td>\n<td>融资成本降低 20-50bps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场准入</td>\n<td>满足大客户的供应商 ESG 要求</td>\n<td>保住/赢得订单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>供应链贡献企业 80-90% 碳排放（Scope 3），ESG 减碳必须深入供应商网络。</li>\n<li>CSRD 等法规将 ESG 从&quot;品牌加分&quot;变为&quot;合规底线&quot;，直接影响供应商选择和成本结构。</li>\n<li>供应商 ESG 管理贯穿准入-运营-发展-退出全生命周期。</li>\n<li>循环供应链通过 Reduce/Reuse/Repair/Remanufacture/Recycle 五大策略创造闭环价值。</li>\n<li>ESG 不只是成本——能效改善、废弃物减少、融资优势和市场准入都带来经济回报。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"supply-chain-resilience\">供应链韧性与风险管理</a> — ESG 合规风险如何纳入供应链风险管理框架</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ecommerce-logistics/reverse-logistics/sustainability\">电商物流：可持续发展</a> — 电商物流环节的绿色实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ESG 与可持续供应链","id":"esg-与可持续供应链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：供应链 ESG 的三维框架","id":"核心概念-供应链-esg-的三维框架"},{"level":2,"text":"碳足迹核算：GHG Protocol 与 GLEC 框架","id":"碳足迹核算-ghg-protocol-与-glec-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商 ESG 管理体系","id":"供应商-esg-管理体系"},{"level":2,"text":"循环供应链（Circular Supply Chain）","id":"循环供应链-circular-supply-chain"},{"level":2,"text":"ESG 合规的技术赋能","id":"esg-合规的技术赋能"},{"level":2,"text":"ESG 供应链的经济性","id":"esg-供应链的经济性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"供应链韧性与风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/strategy/supply-chain-resilience"},"next":null}